# Ignore everything in data/ (raw transcripts, embed_cache.db, sample fixtures,
# etc.) but keep the directory, this file, the prebuilt LanceDB index, and the
# selfie references tracked. Those must be in-tree so the image built in CI —
# which only sees git-tracked files via `actions/checkout` — ships with RAG and
# take_selfie enabled; both features disable themselves when their files are
# missing, so an untracked one fails silently in production. See the
# Dockerfile's data section, `laplace-ingest-streams` / `laplace-ingest-facts`
# for how the tables are (re)built, and docs/selfies.md for the references.
*
!.gitignore
!lancedb/
!lancedb/**
!selfie-references/
!selfie-references/**

# macOS Finder droppings — never commit these, even inside lancedb/.
.DS_Store
